## 4. Frontend Checklist

### Page structure
1. Wrap in `AdminLayout` with `title` + `breadcrumb`.
2. Match visual design from `Theme/Admin/{Module}/` HTML prototypes using design-system utilities (`card-elevated`, `input-field`, `btn-primary`, etc.).
3. Page file: `resources/js/Pages/Admin/{Module}/Index.vue` (PascalCase).
4. Extract repeated/tree/table UI to `resources/js/Components/Admin/`.

### Permissions in Vue (UI only — backend Policy is source of truth)
```js
const permissions = computed(() => page.props.auth?.user?.permissions?.categories ?? {});
const isSuperAdmin = computed(() => page.props.auth?.user?.role === 'super_admin');
const canEdit = computed(() => isSuperAdmin.value || permissions.value.edit === true);
```
- Hide create/edit/delete buttons when unauthorized; never rely on UI alone.

### Forms & navigation
- `useForm()` for all mutations (create/update).
- `<Link>` and `route()` for navigation — never hardcoded URLs.
- `router.patch/post/delete` for inline actions (e.g. drag-and-drop reorder).
- Use `@tabler/icons-vue` exclusively; stroke `1.5`.

---

## 5. New Module File Checklist

When adding an admin resource (e.g. Products), create in this order:

1. `Policy` — map to `config/permissions.php` scope
2. `{Model}Service` — if any non-trivial logic
3. Model scopes — `search`, `status`, `ordered` as needed
4. `Store{Model}Request` + `Update{Model}Request` (+ shared trait if rules overlap)
5. `{Model}Resource` (+ specialized shapes like `CategoryTreeResource` if needed)
6. `Admin\{Model}Controller` — thin, `authorizeResource`, typed returns
7. Routes in `routes/admin.php`
8. `Pages/Admin/{Module}/Index.vue` (+ `Create.vue`, `Edit.vue`)
9. `Components/Admin/` for extracted UI
10. Seeder — use `updateOrCreate(['slug' => ...])` for idempotent seeds

---

## 6. Seeders

```php
Category::query()->updateOrCreate(
    ['slug' => $data['slug']],
    [/* all other fields including parent_id */],
);
```

- Nested data: recursive private method, parent created first then children.
- Re-runnable without duplicate-key errors.
- Keep slugs stable when other seeders reference them (e.g. `ProductSeeder` → `croissants-pastries`).

---

## 7. Do / Don't

| Do | Don't |
|---|---|
| `authorizeResource` + Policy | Inline `if ($user->role === 'admin')` in controllers |
| Resources for every Inertia prop | Pass Eloquent models/collections raw to Vue |
| Scopes for simple query filters | Put tree-building or reorder logic in the model |
| Service for transactions & domain rules | Fat controllers with 50+ lines of logic |
| `updateOrCreate` in seeders | Blind `create()` that fails on re-seed |
| Theme HTML → Vue + design tokens | One-off inline styles bypassing the design system |
| Explicit `authorize()` on custom routes | Assume `authorizeResource` covers non-CRUD actions |

